{"id": "1548043610555949057", "channel_id": "1547502303140126741", "author_id": "304652156286533642", "author_name": "sbpan", "content": "Hello there and welcome aboard <:Saya_yum:1513124263291387975> \n\nAbout wheels : I'd say don't concern yourself with those until you roster feels sturdy enough.\nYou will eventually want 5 teams ( 19 awakeners ) so I'd start there.\nStill, it can be worthwhile to equip just your main team.", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T18:52:38.016000+00:00", "thread_id": "1547502303140126741", "thread_title": "need help in team building & priorities!!", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747088995811358"]}
{"id": "1548044460225593417", "channel_id": "1547502303140126741", "author_id": "304652156286533642", "author_name": "sbpan", "content": "All awakeners currently on banners are great for different reasons. In the end, it mostly boils down to your own playstyle.\n\nYou can borrow them from someone to clear the event, see how they feel in your team before you invest <:Saya_duel:1513123467917135903> \n\nIf you're really lost, you can check Cheri's handbook which includes a tier-list ( just type /new to find the handbook ).\nBut I strongly suggest you let your own experience mold your linups.\n\nAlso, you got time.\nThe current banners are standing for a dozen days still and the anniversary is expected late november. Plenty of time to hoard luminous cores and go on a splurge then <:Saya_caught:1513123193341349968>", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T18:56:00.593000+00:00", "thread_id": "1547502303140126741", "thread_title": "need help in team building & priorities!!", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747088995811358"]}
{"id": "1548045051035390038", "channel_id": "1547502303140126741", "author_id": "304652156286533642", "author_name": "sbpan", "content": "Also, you don't need limited awakeners to dabble in all four realms. Which I strongly recommand while you're still in the early - and quite forgiving - chapters", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T18:58:21.453000+00:00", "thread_id": "1547502303140126741", "thread_title": "need help in team building & priorities!!", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747088995811358"]}
